<title>INDIA: India's TELCO 1996/97 vehicle sales up.</title>
<headline>India's TELCO 1996/97 vehicle sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's leading truckmaker Tata Engineering &amp; Locomotive Company (TELCO) said on Tuesday its vehicle sales climbed 19 percent to 215,261 units in the financial year ended March 31, 1997.  </p>
<p>TELCO said its exports climbed 5.0 percent to 6.75 billion rupees during 1996/97.</p>
</text>
